\**{c=red:Note:}** Progress may be blocked if a Mission NPC has been captured during {p:Besieged}, and will need to be freed first.
=2 Walkthrough
>Nyzul Isle Staging Point to Caedarva Mire (Hediva Island)
!Alzap5.jpg||Map 5
!Alzmap4.jpg||Map 4
!Alzmap9.jpg||Map 9
>Composite Map
!Alzadaal Undersea Ruins Composite Map Larger.png||Zone at top right of Composite Map
* Head to the **Imperial Whitegate** at {p:Aht Urghan Whitegate} (L-9) HP #2 for a cutscene.
* Travel to {z:Caedarva Mire} Map 4 ({p:Hediva Isle}).
** The {p:Unity Warp} (Lv. 135, Shedu) to Caedarva Mire is the fastest way, but requires either {p:Captain} {p:Mercenary Rank} or a {@k} {k:Remnants Permit} from {p:Salvage}.
** Alternatively, take the {p:Runic Portal} to the {p:Nyzul Isle Staging Point} in {z:Alzadaal Undersea Ruins}.
*** From the {p:Nyzul Isle Staging Point}, walk west-northwest towards (H-8) and use the teleporter, marked **D** on Map 5.
*** After you zone, take the teleporter on your left marked as **J** on Map 4.
*** Walk north and zone to Caedarva Mire Map 4 (Hediva Island).
** If you don't have the Nyzul Isle or Unity warp, see the {p:Nyzul Isle Staging Point} page for instructions to walk there.
* When you're ready, go north east through a slightly hidden path and touch the **Savage Scars** at (I-6) beside the __{p:Engraved Tablet}__ for a cutscene.
** The upcoming fight is soloable at iLvl 119 with medium difficulty depending on your job and available trusts.
*** Summon your trust team in advance so your WHM trust gets Protectra V and Shellra V up on foes along the way.
* Touch the **Savage Scars** again for a battle against 1x **Arisen Soulflayer** and 3x **Descended Winebibber** (Clot {m:Slimes|Slime}). 15 minute time limit.
** The **Descended Winebibbers** must also be defeated in order to win.
*** Beware of **Fluid Toss**, a powerful {@g:Physical Damage|Physical} TP move.
** Uran-Mafran will assist in battle. They are a BLM and will melee with a club if the enemy is within melee range, but will otherwise cast spells from his position.
*** Uran-Mafran stays at range unless he takes hate.
*** If Uran-Mafran is KOed then the fight is lost. They may be cured like any other NPC.

* Select the **Savage Scars** again for a cutscene.

* Head back to the **Imperial Whitegate** at {p:Aht Urghan Whitegate} (L-9) for a cutscene.
** You will obtain {@k} {k:Mnejing's receiver} as a reward allowing you to hear {p:Besieged} messages outside of Aht Urghan.
** Completing the quest "{q:A Stygian Pact|A Stygian Pact|A Stygian Pact}" will unlock an extra dialogue option with regards to Odin.

=2 Notes
* You can now open up access to new {p:RoE Quests 4|Category:Records of Eminence} objectives.
** See the NPC {n:Elijah} in {z:Upper Jeuno} near Home Point #1 for more information.

